sequenceDiagram
    participant C as HTTP Client
    participant S as Lab Web Server
    C->>S: SYN
    S-->>C: SYN-ACK
    C->>S: ACK
    Note over C,S: TCP connection established
    C->>S: GET / HTTP/1.1
    S-->>C: ACK request bytes
    S-->>C: HTTP/1.1 200 OK + HTML body
    C->>S: ACK response bytes
    C->>S: FIN-ACK
    S-->>C: FIN-ACK
    C->>S: ACK
